{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:04.96] 808\n[00:05.94] 808, '08, 808\n[00:08.42] Gang, gang\n[00:10.30] We in Chiraq, ya dig? (Skrrt, grrah)\n[Refrain]\n[00:14.22] Yesterday, I tweaked, then I took a Xan'\n[00:16.66] (808 Mafia)\n[00:17.56] Today, I said that I won't do that shit again\n[00:21.10] My brother told me to describe the perfect bitch\n[00:23.88] I said, \"Percocets\" (Hahaha)\n[00:26.36] I said, \"Percocets\" (For real), yeah\n[Verse 1]\n[00:28.00] Yeah, the blue pills (The blue pills)\n[00:30.46] They give me the perfect itch (Oh yeah)\n[00:31.94] She told me she want her a Birkin bag\n[00:33.52] Better put the Percs in a Birkin, bitch (Oh yeah)\n[00:35.62] My ex bitch call me a snake, wait, I'ma show you what a serpent is (Oh yeah)\n[00:39.08] Look in the mirror\n[00:40.28] The vision can't get any clearer (Uh)\n[00:42.00] Anyways, nigga, it's my year (Uh)\n[00:43.48] Ball 'til I'm bald like Britney Spears (Uh-huh)\n[00:45.84] Three-round burst up in that choppa, grrah, musketeers (Uh, uh-huh)\n[00:49.22] Codeine in my double cup, I am not drinking beer (Sip, sip, sip)\n[00:52.92] Uh, I ain't take no pills today, I'm startin' to get the bubble guts (What the fuck? What the fuck?)\n[00:57.38] Twin barrels on that shotty, yeah, and it's a horny gun (Grrah)\n[01:00.00] I'm gon' cock it back, let it off and watch it double nut (Grrah, grrah, grrah)\n[01:04.08] I also got my .40 tucked, that's another horny one (Oh yeah)\n[01:07.06] Got so many horny guns, you thought we were shootin' a porn or somethin' (Smash)\n[01:10.94] Uh, shoot like the Mavericks (Ah)\n[01:12.10] Couple semis and a few automatics (Uh-huh)\n[01:13.90] Run up on me, you get caught up in traffic (Uh-huh)\n[01:15.68] All my niggas stretch him out like elastic (Uh-huh), yeah, yeah\n[01:18.20] You don't want static, but me? I'm havin' it\n[01:21.10] I'll leave your body packaged like the bricks in my cabinet (Yeah)\n[Chorus]\n[01:24.90] I ain't have no Percs, I'm mad (Bitch!)\n[01:26.62] Make me wanna shoot your dad (Bitch!)\n[01:28.46] I feel like a savage, huh, still a sad kid\n[01:31.74] I ain't have no Percs, I'm mad (Bitch!)\n[01:33.74] Make me wanna shoot your dad (Bitch!)\n[01:35.12] I feel like a savage, huh, still a sad kid, ooh-ooh\n[01:40.74] Uh, demons in my head, leave me alone\n[01:44.72] Uh, I think I'll be better off alone\n[01:48.90] In my mind, I roam\n[Verse 2]\n[01:54.16] Feeling delirious (What?)\n[01:55.66] Ran out of Percocets, bitch, is you serious? (What, what?)\n[01:57.72] Them drugs control me like a eye in the middle of a pyramid\n[02:01.02] I need some more, period\n[02:02.10] I mean point-blank, motherfuckin' period\n[02:04.34] Uh, don't try to understand, you will never understand\n[02:10.64] Broke-up with the drugs, but I need a second chance\n[02:14.02] I'll do whatever it takes, I'll even take on a Dr. Phil\n[02:17.48] That's how you know it's real, huh\n[02:19.10] Love, for real, love, for real, love, for real (I'm in love, for real)\n[02:22.24] I gave her a chance\n[02:24.66] The Devil wanna dance\n[02:27.98] That wasn't a part of the plan\n[02:29.60] I only came down here to buy some Xans (Buy some Xans)\n[Refrain]\n[02:36.44] Yesterday, I tweaked, then I took a Xan'\n[02:39.78] Today, I said that I won't do that shit again\n[02:43.32] My brother told me to describe the perfect bitch\n[02:46.76] I said, \"Percocets\"\n[02:48.58] I said, \"Percocets,\" yeah\n[Chorus]\n[02:50.00] I ain't have no Percs, I'm mad (Bitch!)\n[02:51.72] Make me wanna shoot your dad (Bitch!)\n[02:53.56] I feel like a savage, huh, still a sad kid\n[02:56.84] I ain't have no Percs, I'm mad (Bitch!)\n[02:58.84] Make me wanna shoot your dad (Bitch!)\n[03:00.22] I feel like a savage, huh, still a sad kid, ooh-ooh\n[03:05.84] Uh, demons in my head, leave me alone\n[03:09.82] Uh, I think I'll be better off alone\n[03:14.00] In my mind, I roam","words":[[2.0,4.94,"[Intro]"],[4.96,5.94,"808"],[5.94,5.98,"808,"],[6.68,6.68,"'08,"],[6.7,8.14,"808"],[8.42,8.7,